#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patient hunter"
msgstr "Cacciatore paziente"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Be patient enough not to waste your ammunitions."
msgstr "Impara la pazienza per non sprecare colpi."

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patient"
msgstr "Patient"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise"
msgstr "Esercizio"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You must find a way to destroy the four moving <a object|bottarg>target "
"bots</a> without wasting one shot. Notice that after every move, the targets"
" will stay motionless during one second."
msgstr ""
"Distruggi i quattro <a object|bottarg>robot bersaglio</a> mobili senza "
"sprecare un colpo. Dopo ogni spostamento restano fermi per un secondo."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "General principle"
msgstr "Principio generale"

#. type: Bullet: '1)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Detect a target with the instruction <c/><a "
"cbot|radar>radar</a>(TargetBot);<n/>."
msgstr "Trova un bersaglio con <c/><a cbot|radar>radar</a>(TargetBot);<n/>."

#. type: Bullet: '2)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Turn towards the target with <c/><a cbot|turn>turn</a>(direction());<n/>."
msgstr "Girati verso di esso con <c/><a cbot|turn>turn</a>(direction());<n/>."

#. type: Bullet: '3)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "After the rotation, check if the target did not move."
msgstr "Dopo la rotazione, controlla che non si sia mosso."

#. type: Bullet: '4)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If it did not, wait 0.2 seconds with <c/><a cbot|wait>wait</a>(0.2);<n/>."
msgstr ""
"Se è fermo, attendi 0,2 secondi con <c/><a cbot|wait>wait</a>(0.2);<n/>."

#. type: Bullet: '5)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Re-check if the target did not move."
msgstr "Controlla ancora che sia fermo."

#. type: Bullet: '6)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If it did not, shoot with <c/><a cbot|fire>fire</a>(2);<n/> and wait 2 "
"seconds for the target to be hit by the bullets and destroyed."
msgstr ""
"Se lo è, spara con <c/><a cbot|fire>fire</a>(2);<n/> e attendi 2 secondi "
"perché i colpi lo raggiungano e lo distruggano."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are of course other ways to achieve the goal."
msgstr "Naturalmente esistono altre soluzioni."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remark"
msgstr "Osservazione"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In order to increase the efficiency of your shots, aim a little downward "
"with <c/><a cbot|aim>aim</a>(-3);<n/>."
msgstr ""
"Per migliorare il tiro, mira leggermente in basso con <c/><a "
"cbot|aim>aim</a>(-3);<n/>."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a "
"cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a "
"cbot|category>categorie</a>."
